/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E (The Romdhan Journey API is a RESTful web service designed to support users throughout Ramadhan. It provides centralized access to religious and cultural resources, including prayers, Doua, Adhkar, Khatma tracking, and traditional recipes. The API allows users to save favorites, create personal content, and monitor their spiritual journey. Built with a modular and scalable architecture, it offers flexibility for both public and personalized features, enabling developers to integrate it into web and mobile applications.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
